        (13, 13, """`SCAN_EVERY`: run the heavy analysis once per 100 samples, once per second."""),
        (14, 14, """`HOLD_SCANS`: after the last accepted heart rate, keep showing it through 3 further scans that do not produce a new one, so the number does not flicker out for a single missed second."""),
        (15, 15, """`MEMORY_SCANS`: a heart rate accepted within the last 15 scans (about 15 seconds) is remembered, and a candidate rate that jumps by more than 25% from it is held to a stricter standard (see the guard below)."""),
